# Baleful Mastery: "You may pay {1}{B} rather than pay this spell's mana cost. If the {1}{B} cost was paid, an opponent
# draws a card. Exile target creature or planeswalker." Three players: the controller chooses which opponent draws as the
# spell resolves (CR 608.2d), here Bot3, and the target is exiled. Bot1 casts it on turn 1 against its own Ornithopter
# (the first player of a game of more than two draws on turn 1, CR 103.8a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Baleful Mastery
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x10

[Bot3 Deck]
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Baleful Mastery.Cast(Ornithopter; Ability: {1}{B})
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.ChoosePlayer(Bot3)
